wallpaper-con-citas (1.2.2) resolute; urgency=medium
  * A minor bug was fixed; the CONFIG_FONT file (containing the "selected font") is ignored if set to `false`, so `FONTE_DEFAULT` is not used.
  * Error fixed: the translation file that had been lost was recovered.

  * The language flag—which allows switching between English and Spanish—now also supports: Arabic, Bengali, German, Greek, Persian (Iran), French, Gujarati, Hindi, Indonesian, Italian, Japanese, Lithuanian, Portuguese, Romanian, Russian, Slovak, Tamil, Thai, Ukrainian, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese.
  * ☝️ These languages ​​are available on the Sadhguru and Prem Rawat websites.
  * For Siva P. and Sri Sri Ravi Shankar—as well as the "Other authors"—we use the `translate` command.
  * It also remembers the selected language upon restarting.
  * The font selector now includes thumbnails showing the font icon, providing a visual reference for the typeface's style. You can also configure it to remember your chosen font upon restarting, or it will default to: `./fonts/C059-BdIta.t1`. Hope you enjoy it.
  

  * Enabled the background-change entry in the history list under "Set as wallpaper." Configured the "Other authors" search input field to trigger a random search. Fixed the "Info" window to include active links. ~*Final touches*~
  * Se activó el registro de cambio de fondo en la lista hitorial, en \"Set as wallpaper\". Se activó que si el campo de entrada de texto la búsqueda de "\Otros autores\", se genere un búsqueda aleatoria. Se reparó la ventana de \"Info\" con links activos. ~*Úlitmos retoques*~

  * Bug fixes - If the quote is disabled, do not display the empty text box; instead, it should remain empty unless "Edit text" is selected. Allow closing the image editing window with Ctrl+W, and the main window with Ctrl+Q. Refine the code so that the Prem quote output includes the event venue name, if mentioned.
  * The Prem quotes might be getting blocked due to too many requests. We are now loading them locally from the `banco.json` file. And minor code refinements.
  * It was necessary to correct an error related to \"Other authors.\" It only displays the following - No citations found. /Final revision.
  * Latest fixes; Added writing "metadata" to image. Changed so that it does not overwrite if the quote is changed. And it was fixed at the Quote Edition in the image, more stable.
  * Add a transparent option to text background.
  * Fix a bug on "Other authors" download quotes method.
  * Now, images can be downloaded from additional servers, such as pixabay.com and www.pexels.com. We also have a comprehensive «Otros autores» list—downloaded just once—that simplifies the process of searching for authors and retrieving citations.
  * Add the icon file.
  * An application for downloading wallpapers from Wallhaven/Picsum and overlaying stylized quotes—in English or Spanish—directly onto the image. Initial release.

